      "text": "The Daemonic Infector exhales a 30-foot line of concentrated fumes.\n\nEach creature in the area takes 12d10 poison damage (DC 44 basic Fortitude save save; on a critical failure the creature is also Drained 1).\n\nThe Infector can't Breathe Death again for 1d4 rounds."
